WEBVTT

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:03.660
I don't want everyone to hate me!

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:16.250
Is she asleep?

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.630
Yeah, finally.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.550
Then come with me for a second.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.290
What?  She tried to take some crayons?

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.000
Yeah, she said she was going to draw a picture of me.

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:44.710
Don't cry!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:45.830
It won't help.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:53.490
But... doesn't Yuzuyu-chan... already have some crayons?

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:57.210
When I asked her about them, she wouldn't say anything.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.860
Well, kids...

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.580
when they are really hurt...

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:12.980
they won't tell an adult.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.890
So adults have to notice it for themselves.

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.890
Yuzuyu-chan only has you right now.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:27.980
Yeah.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.940
But I wonder what's wrong with her.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.600
But...

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.140
Nee-chan, what's up with your room?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:43.400
It's doesn't even seem like it's inside our house.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.230
Okay, we're all set!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:02.400
Today's side dish is a pork cutlet; it'll help you feel better.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.100
I'm fine though.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.970
Try to eat it all!

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:11.900
Okay!

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.700
Today, I'll hurry to pick you up!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.640
Yay!  Yay!!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.160
Kippei, what are you reading?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:30.120
Have you... finally... at last?

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.320
Leave me alone!

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.550
I'm just trying to understand a young girl's heart.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.580
What?  Who would that be?

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.090
Hey, girls...

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:47.840
what makes a girl depressed?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:52.280
Ahh... That's a tough question...

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:58.030
but I remember the time when my boyfriend was laughing at the news...

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.370
and he said he was worried about the future of Japan.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:05.580
Thursdays always get me down.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.290
First period is gym and it makes the rest of the day seem so long.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.320
Okay already.  Sorry.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.760
You don't seem satisfied.  How annoying.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:34.470
Why?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.140
Why does he only think about that kid?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.650
He didn't used to be like this.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:40.980
Kippei...

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.400
It's only because that girl is here.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.830
What are you doing, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.550
We're in the middle of a lesson.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.080
O-Okay!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.980
Goodbye!

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:48.820
Hey, Katakura!

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:49.790
Katakura!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.000
I'm not finished talking to you!

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.370
Yuzuyu-chan only has you right now.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.420
Excuse me...

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:13.210
I'm trying to get to Matsuo's house on 3rd Street...

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.630
but I'm a little lost.

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.440
Could you help me out?

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:20.590
I have this map.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.080
You're looking for 3rd Street?

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.210
Well, this is 5th Street.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.750
Oh, I'm so tired.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.130
Okay.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.270
I'll go with you.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:37.860
Thank you.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.720
You're so kind.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:45.900
I'll be right there to pick you up, as soon as I take this lady to her destination.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.660
Thank you.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.090
Yes, yes.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.840
Goodbye!

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:06.660
Kippei-onii-chan,

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:08.770
you're late.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:15.440
You know, Kippei-san can't deal with you all the time.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.110
He told me he would rush over here today.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.640
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.980
You were a great help.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.900
I know it's not much, but...

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.530
I hope Yuzuyu will forgive me and enjoy these.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.030
Thank you.  Well, I really have to go now.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.060
Dash!

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:28.940
Are you okay?

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.690
No... No!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.320
Do you really dislike me that much?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:02.290
Don't cry!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.770
I don't like you either.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.680
I-I said don't cry!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:32.760
What are you doing?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.400
S-She tripped...

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.240
so I was going to help her.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:55.520
Are you the one who's been doing something to her lately?

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.330
What are you talking about?  I didn't...

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.280
Who are you?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.200
That uniform...

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:07.940
We go to the same school, right?

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.630
What were you about to do to her?

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:25.720
Hey!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.070
I was so scared!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.810
It's okay now, calm down.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.610
What's going on?

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.310
Do you know this person?

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.290
Nope, I don't know her...

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:22.730
I don't want you to be thinking of other girls.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.850
You don't need her...

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.350
you can have me.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.020
No, seriously girls...

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.170
Do you know this person.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.040
I don't know her.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.660
Hey, do you know this person?

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.560
Nope.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.670
Who is that?

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:41.380
Do you know?

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.530
Nope.  I don't know her.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.490
Oh, and also...

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.130
Tokunaga, wait... what is it?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.550
This is terrible.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:01.830
Leave me alone.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:03.570
Give it back.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.540
First year, class D: Onada Kyoko.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:07.200
What?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.750
First year, class D: Onada Kyoko.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:14.480
What?  This person?

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:20.500
First year, class D: Onada Kyoko.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:21.840
Okay, I get it.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:29.110
Don't you remember when I told you about that girl with your picture?

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.810
Oh yeah, I remember you saying that.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:47.290
What?  You looked her up?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:51.880
Seriously?

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:54.300
Idiot.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.050
Who are you?

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.860
Can I talk to you for a minute?

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.560
I know it's sudden...

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:29.670
but what did you do to Yuzuyu?

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.990
Did Yuzuyu do something to you?

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:41.440
Or is it something about me?

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.760
I'm stupid, but if you explain it to me, I'll understand.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:56.250
So if I annoy you or anything, please tell me what it is.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.180
I like you.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:10.880
What?  You like... me?

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:19.150
At first, it was okay just watching you from afar...

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.030
but I couldn't help myself any longer.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:30.730
I didn't worry, because you were never serious about any one girl.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.820
I understand that girl is very special to you.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:42.060
So, instead of Mama, Kippei-onii-chan makes my lunches for me.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.940
Are you two always together?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.170
Yep.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.620
We eat and sleep together.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.190
I was so jealous...

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:57.350
and I got so sad.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:01.780
What's going on?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.850
Should I go get the teacher?

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.070
Wait a minute.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.400
I'm sorry.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.670
I can't say I feel the same way,

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.280
but I am flattered that you like me.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.000
However, that girl is very special to me...

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.240
so please don't ever do anything to her again.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.770
Alright, I won't do anything anymore.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.510
I don't know what I was thinking.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.600
I won't ever do that again.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:41.630
I'm glad that you understand.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.200
Could you please tell her that I'm sorry?

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.450
I'll let her know.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.890
And also...

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.740
Could you please shake my hand?

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:59.560
Are you a celebrity, Kippei?

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.870
Well, I'm glad that's all sorted out.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:04.810
Yeah, really.

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:06.920
But that girl...

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:09.980
I can understand how she feels though.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:11.470
Really?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.060
Don't you understand?

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:05.130
Thank you.

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:09.820
Kokoro-chin.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.850
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:16.210
That hurts!  I'm sorry!

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.760
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.960
I really am grateful.

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.920
Kokoro-chan, you're really cute when you smile.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.910
You should smile more!

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.260
Really, I didn't know you could smile!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:48.130
Why are yoou ignoring me?!

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:13.490
Kippei-onii-chan, are you asleep?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.030
What is it with you?  You're too cute!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.040
I'm going to tickle you!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.490
You know what?  You know what?

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:41.490
There were crayons in my backpack when I got to preschool!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:42.950
Why?

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.450
You're joking.  Maybe it was Santa.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.350
Santa?

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.070
Are you sleepy?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:53.200
Yeah.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:54.640
Then go to sleep.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:57.430
No!  The scary thing will get me!

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:58.920
She won't bother you anymore.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.290
She said she was sorry, so you'll be fine.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.620
You'll be here when I wake up, won't you?

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:08.810
Yep, I'll be here.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.030
Do you want me to sing you a lullaby?

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.470
I don't need those anymore.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.000
I'm 5 years old!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:23.260
Sleep, sleep well.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.260
No!  You're horrible!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:26.920
Why you...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.550
I really love you, Kippei-onii-chan.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.260
Alright, go to sleep now.

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:49.810
I'm home!

00:23:50.180 --> 00:23:53.170
Kippei?  Yuzu-chan?  Are you here?

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:59.080
Aha.  They're sleeping.

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:01.500
They get along so well.

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:05.250
Every time they have to part, it becomes harder for Kippei.

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:23.120
Everyone says I'm trying to stand out.

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:25.360
Why is that?

00:24:25.570 --> 00:24:27.080
Probably because you're so cute.

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:28.210
You think so?

00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:30.820
And you have a good looking Onii-chan.

00:24:31.020 --> 00:24:31.990
You think so?

00:24:32.270 --> 00:24:34.680
It's because her uniform is different from everyone else's.

00:24:37.180 --> 00:24:38.730
I hadn't noticed!

00:24:38.850 --> 00:24:39.380
Really?

00:24:40.270 --> 00:24:42.120
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:42.820 --> 00:24:44.480
Bye-Bye Yellow Hat!

00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:46.750
Find me, Mama!
